WEBVTT

00:05.380 --> 00:07.730
Archon Dakini.

00:08.220 --> 00:10.450
I will now give you your mission.

00:10.920 --> 00:13.470
You can count on me, my Emperor!

00:13.470 --> 00:16.810
I will use my power to make 
the humans' desires stronger

00:16.810 --> 00:19.080
so they'll keep having babies.

00:19.080 --> 00:22.380
A rise in population will make 
this country even better!

00:22.380 --> 00:23.090
Nay.

00:25.210 --> 00:30.960
Your role is to use that ability to 
erase the people's desires related to love,

00:30.960 --> 00:34.060
so that they will not create 
unsanctioned offspring.

00:34.390 --> 00:34.850
What?

00:34.850 --> 00:37.560
That is what you were made for.

00:37.970 --> 00:40.540
My Emperor, are you serious?

00:40.540 --> 00:42.920
I mean, if people stop making children,

00:42.920 --> 00:45.390
humanity is going to, like, go under.

00:46.400 --> 00:48.880
We'll create them artificially.

00:48.880 --> 00:53.980
The assembly and I have developed a 
method to artificially create humans.

00:53.980 --> 00:56.870
We will use it to control 
the number of humans.

00:57.230 --> 00:59.950
There's no need for them to reproduce freely.

00:59.950 --> 01:04.050
Everything must be steady and unchanging.

02:36.010 --> 02:41.010
Episode 8
We know we are not worthy
O great Lord Mitama
Evil cannot touch

02:36.310 --> 02:37.940
We know we are not worthy

02:37.940 --> 02:39.180
O great Lord Mitama

02:39.180 --> 02:41.010
Evil cannot touch

02:42.470 --> 02:44.600
Big Sister, what do you 
mean by something good?

02:44.600 --> 02:45.890
What are we going to play?

02:47.770 --> 02:50.060
No need to rush.

02:50.060 --> 02:52.060
You just leave it all to me.

02:52.560 --> 02:53.440
Emanate.

02:56.400 --> 02:57.940
And that's it.

03:02.990 --> 03:05.950
<i>Ever since the day the 
Emperor told me what to do,</i>

03:06.790 --> 03:14.170
<i>I've spent every day erasing all 
human desires related to love.</i>

03:15.170 --> 03:17.670
<i>And after thousands of years,</i>

03:18.420 --> 03:21.260
<i>one day, something unusual happened.</i>

03:23.260 --> 03:25.720
<i>Their fertility is... gone?</i>

03:26.560 --> 03:28.430
<i>But I didn't even do anything.</i>

03:29.600 --> 03:31.890
<i>The Empire's people began to be born</i>

03:31.890 --> 03:37.190
<i>without desires related to love 
and without the ability to reproduce.</i>

03:41.280 --> 03:44.030
<i>I lost my reason to exist.</i>

03:44.030 --> 03:46.490
Hey, what's that book?

03:46.490 --> 03:48.290
S and M...

03:48.290 --> 03:49.660
What does that mean?

03:49.660 --> 03:52.040
<i>As a form of rebellion,</i>

03:52.040 --> 03:56.670
<i>I wrote my knowledge about sex into books 
and began circulating them in the capital.</i>

03:56.670 --> 04:00.010
Why is this guy happy to get beaten?

04:00.010 --> 04:01.510
I don't get this at all.

04:02.300 --> 04:04.760
<i>They did end up being banned though.</i>

04:06.140 --> 04:09.770
<i>Even more time passed, and then one day,</i>

04:09.770 --> 04:13.140
<i>I met a young girl.</i>

04:15.100 --> 04:16.110
This is wrong...

04:16.690 --> 04:18.900
You can't lick someone there...

04:19.610 --> 04:20.900
Hey, you.

04:22.440 --> 04:24.320
What are you reading?

04:26.030 --> 04:28.830
Oh, but this is a banned book!

04:26.030 --> 04:30.080
Ahhh, please give it back...

04:28.830 --> 04:30.620
You little weirdo.

04:31.330 --> 04:37.080
<i>Oddly, she had been born into this 
world with the capacity to feel love.</i>

04:37.080 --> 04:40.670
<i>Hey, would you like to learn 
something even more amazing?</i>

04:41.170 --> 04:45.720
<i>Her name was Toka, and she became my bud.</i>

04:45.940 --> 04:48.430
Dakini, look at this!

04:48.650 --> 04:50.600
Look at this amazing vegetable!

04:50.600 --> 04:52.140
It has such a lewd shape!

04:52.140 --> 04:54.980
There you go being pervy again.

04:58.520 --> 05:04.110
<i>She was an anomaly in this world and couldn't 
get along with people in the capital.</i>

05:04.950 --> 05:08.660
<i>But I liked her more than them.</i>

05:09.280 --> 05:12.660
<i>Unlike those lifeless, robotic people,</i>

05:12.660 --> 05:15.960
<i>she lived by following 
her heart, her instincts.</i>

05:16.540 --> 05:20.540
<i>I thought that was the correct 
way a living being should be.</i>

05:21.460 --> 05:25.010
<i>Eventually, Toka was taken 
away to an isolation camp.</i>

05:25.630 --> 05:27.630
<i>Those who feared the end of life system,</i>

05:27.630 --> 05:30.100
<i>those who felt love,</i>

05:30.100 --> 05:32.680
<i>all those who don't fit into 
the Empire's administration were</i>

05:32.680 --> 05:34.430
<i>shunted off to the isolation camps.</i>

05:34.430 --> 05:39.480
<i>But I thought life in the isolation 
camp would suit her better.</i>

05:40.150 --> 05:41.360
Take care.

05:42.650 --> 05:44.150
<i>But then, a few years later,</i>

05:46.860 --> 05:50.070
<i>Toka was killed by the others 
in her isolation camp.</i>

05:50.820 --> 05:52.740
<i>After she had slept with someone at the camp,</i>

05:52.740 --> 05:55.120
<i>she had a child, which frightened them all.</i>

06:04.210 --> 06:08.050
<i>Since this country used artificial 
means to control the population,</i>

06:08.510 --> 06:12.890
<i>a child hadn't been born 
naturally in a long time.</i>

06:12.890 --> 06:18.940
<i>That's why the baby and the parent who had 
given birth were treated as monstrous things.</i>

06:21.310 --> 06:23.940
I've made up my mind, Toka.

06:24.360 --> 06:27.570
I'm going to return the humans of 
this land to their original state.

06:27.900 --> 06:30.530
Humans will fall in love,

06:30.530 --> 06:32.240
they will form families,

06:32.240 --> 06:33.950
they will have children.

06:33.950 --> 06:36.250
I will make a world where that's possible.

06:36.660 --> 06:38.710
No matter what it takes.

06:53.510 --> 06:54.470
Atar!

06:54.970 --> 06:57.180
Good! We made it!

06:57.180 --> 06:58.600
And Sil?

07:01.020 --> 07:02.480
We came to save you.

07:08.070 --> 07:11.280
<b>Followers</b>

07:09.570 --> 07:12.360
What?!

07:11.280 --> 07:15.830
<b>Followers</b>

07:12.360 --> 07:15.830
How do you have so many followers?!

07:26.920 --> 07:27.710
Now's our chance!

07:27.710 --> 07:28.380
Run!

07:28.380 --> 07:29.260
Okay!

07:36.970 --> 07:37.890
Riche-san!

07:42.350 --> 07:44.230
<i>I really need this book.</i>

07:49.280 --> 07:53.660
Got you!

07:55.620 --> 07:57.490
I guess our plan barely worked out.

07:57.950 --> 08:00.870
What is that little girl doing here?

08:00.870 --> 08:02.750
What's up with her follower count?!

08:03.420 --> 08:07.710
Your follower count has been dwindling ever 
since you've left the village, right?

08:07.710 --> 08:12.630
People's faith fades quickly if 
their god isn't directly by them.

08:12.970 --> 08:15.930
But do you know where all 
those followers went?

08:15.930 --> 08:17.220
Don't tell me...

08:18.100 --> 08:19.350
That's right.

08:19.520 --> 08:21.680
All of your followers transferred over

08:21.680 --> 08:26.690
to the person who stayed behind 
and kept protecting the village: Atar.

08:26.900 --> 08:30.400
Why though?!

08:30.980 --> 08:35.030
I had prepared two lines of 
attack against Dakini's group.

08:35.030 --> 08:38.530
My first was to infiltrate Dakini's group,

08:38.530 --> 08:42.040
sow division among her 
ranks, and dilute her power.

08:42.040 --> 08:47.330
My second was to concentrate our 
village's followers on Atar.

08:47.560 --> 08:49.840
If we're talking about raw combat power,

08:49.840 --> 08:51.960
Atar's stronger than you.

08:52.380 --> 08:55.090
That's why I concentrated 
our power on one point.

08:55.510 --> 08:57.470
From the very start,

08:57.470 --> 09:00.100
my plan was to take over 
Dakini's group by force.

09:00.100 --> 09:02.060
You deceived me, Yukito!

09:02.060 --> 09:06.020
I should've never left the village!

09:07.560 --> 09:09.060
Heyo!

09:14.820 --> 09:16.570
Where do you think you're going?

09:17.030 --> 09:18.490
Dakini.

09:18.490 --> 09:19.740
Gohonzon-sama.

09:20.200 --> 09:22.950
You're the one Loki's taken a liking to.

09:23.410 --> 09:26.120
Quite the stir you've caused here.

09:26.870 --> 09:30.210
I can't believe you managed 
to make Riche-tan betray me.

09:33.010 --> 09:36.340
Why... do you have that?

09:37.970 --> 09:40.390
That's Toka's...

09:45.980 --> 09:46.770
Riche!

09:50.400 --> 09:51.770
Time for phase two!

09:53.400 --> 09:55.900
Wa-Wa-Wait, where are you going?

09:56.530 --> 10:04.200
Dakini, you're going to pay for going 
against the Emperor and the assembly.

10:09.250 --> 10:10.790
For real?

10:10.790 --> 10:14.050
You're still nattering on about 
the assembly and the Emperor?

10:14.550 --> 10:18.220
Could you maybe be Atar-tan?

10:19.340 --> 10:21.350
Loki-tan told me all about it.

10:21.350 --> 10:23.390
The Emperor's gone,

10:23.390 --> 10:26.810
so now you're wagging your tail for 
another owner or something?

10:26.810 --> 10:28.440
I think you have potential...

10:28.440 --> 10:29.770
to be a slut—

10:36.900 --> 10:38.700
I won't kill you.

10:38.700 --> 10:42.240
But I'll make sure you won't 
be able to act against us.

10:42.870 --> 10:47.290
You stupid neophyte, you were only 
built at the end stage of the Empire!

10:47.290 --> 10:50.290
And you don't know anything!

10:55.500 --> 10:59.550
I guess she's been hiding 
her power like Atar did!

10:59.550 --> 11:00.510
Hey,

11:00.510 --> 11:04.640
do you even get the scale of my group
 and how many followers it has?

11:05.060 --> 11:08.230
I'll show you who won't be going...

11:08.770 --> 11:11.020
<b>Followers</b>

11:09.270 --> 11:11.020
against who.

11:14.730 --> 11:17.110
Hey, what are you trying to do?

11:17.110 --> 11:18.860
Take me back to Yukito!

11:19.360 --> 11:22.860
Right now, I am enacting the plan 
as Yukito-san told me to!

11:23.320 --> 11:26.830
He told me that whether it fails 
or succeeds is all up to you!

11:26.830 --> 11:29.000
What, really?

11:29.370 --> 11:33.130
Could it be that Yukito is 
actually counting on me?

11:34.630 --> 11:37.800
That's Toka's...

11:39.050 --> 11:42.180
<i>Why does she know my mother's name?</i>

11:51.520 --> 11:52.750
Here it comes!

12:15.060 --> 12:16.330
What is this?

12:16.810 --> 12:18.100
Hmm?

12:18.100 --> 12:22.190
You still haven't lost your 
head despite that, huh?

12:22.780 --> 12:24.110
Not bad.

12:24.900 --> 12:30.160
But you don't have to keep it in anymore.

12:30.740 --> 12:31.450
What are you—

12:32.200 --> 12:34.080
Just let it go.

12:49.050 --> 12:53.010
This is bad.
This is too powerful!

12:53.470 --> 12:58.690
None of you can go against me anymore.

13:00.610 --> 13:03.690
Yukito-san...

13:01.440 --> 13:03.690
Yukito...

13:04.940 --> 13:06.650
I can't resist anymore.

13:06.650 --> 13:08.990
Sorry, Al.

13:11.070 --> 13:12.740
It's all right.

13:12.740 --> 13:14.830
If it's with you...

13:19.290 --> 13:20.040
Hey!

13:20.040 --> 13:22.540
Sil? Al?

13:22.540 --> 13:23.670
You two...!

13:24.880 --> 13:29.010
Let's do it, Yukito.

13:30.680 --> 13:34.890
Yukito-san, let's do it.

13:35.270 --> 13:37.640
You two need to calm down!

13:37.640 --> 13:39.100
Yukito...

13:40.940 --> 13:43.590
Atar, do something about them!

13:44.320 --> 13:47.150
Something's wrong with me...

13:47.150 --> 13:48.780
You, too, Atar?!

13:49.610 --> 13:50.910
Stop it!

13:52.320 --> 13:53.660
See?

13:53.660 --> 13:58.750
It feels so good that your 
brain's getting all melty, huh?

13:58.750 --> 14:00.710
Your reason is gone.

14:00.710 --> 14:03.840
You won't be going against 
what I say anymore.

14:03.840 --> 14:05.210
It's fine.

14:05.630 --> 14:06.760
Just give in.

14:06.760 --> 14:08.010
Give in.

14:11.220 --> 14:12.510
I can't...

14:24.940 --> 14:26.130
<i>This is...</i>

14:29.690 --> 14:31.820
I kept you waiting, huh, Yukito?

14:31.820 --> 14:33.910
The new child follower?

14:33.910 --> 14:36.830
And Riche-tan?

14:37.490 --> 14:39.250
I'm not a child!

14:39.250 --> 14:41.160
I am an omnipotent and absolute god!

14:41.160 --> 14:42.750
I'm Mitama-sama!

14:42.750 --> 14:44.210
A god?

14:44.210 --> 14:46.340
So you're an archon, too?

14:46.960 --> 14:50.170
I've never heard the name Mitama before.

14:50.170 --> 14:53.450
You must have had some 
really bottom-tier job.

14:53.450 --> 14:56.100
Don't you dare compare me to fakes like you!

14:56.100 --> 14:58.460
I'm a real god!

14:59.560 --> 15:00.750
Gohonzon-sama.

15:01.180 --> 15:03.350
No... Dakini!

15:03.350 --> 15:05.800
I am splitting off from you!

15:06.560 --> 15:07.190
Huh?

15:07.520 --> 15:12.450
Our Riche faction have decided to 
revere Mitama-sama as our god!

15:13.570 --> 15:19.120
With the newest sexual knowledge I possess 
and the scientific sex toys Mitama-sama conjures,

15:19.120 --> 15:22.120
we will ascend to new sexual heights!

15:22.120 --> 15:24.080
Your era is over!

15:24.080 --> 15:28.750
This is the beginning of a new sexual era!

15:28.750 --> 15:30.210
Riche-sama! Riche-sama!

15:30.210 --> 15:31.920
Yes, it's all about prostate training!

15:31.920 --> 15:33.760
Naw, it's all about prostate training!

15:33.760 --> 15:34.880
If you say training,

15:34.880 --> 15:37.510
it's gotta be the prostate!

15:37.510 --> 15:39.510
Just in the nick of time.

15:40.060 --> 15:47.400
Now all of the Riche faction followers have 
been fully transferred from you to Mitama.

15:48.730 --> 15:50.530
So, what?

15:50.530 --> 15:53.090
Even if I lose that amount of followers,

15:53.090 --> 15:55.860
it won't make a dent in my 
absolute advantage here!

15:56.240 --> 15:56.950
What?

15:58.030 --> 15:59.740
My powers aren't working?!

16:01.120 --> 16:02.750
I told you.

16:02.750 --> 16:05.960
You're nothing but a bunch of fakes.

16:06.330 --> 16:10.070
Don't you underestimate 
a real god, little girl.

16:24.230 --> 16:26.250
What did you do?

16:26.460 --> 16:28.100
I remembered something.

16:28.480 --> 16:31.730
I knew a god called Dakini.

16:32.070 --> 16:33.820
And that's when I realized...

16:33.820 --> 16:39.570
you fakes are probably just borrowing 
your powers from actual gods.

16:41.120 --> 16:42.410
What are you talking about?

16:42.410 --> 16:49.250
It means that the power you were using was 
actually the power of the god called Dakini.

16:49.880 --> 16:51.460
But ultimately,

16:51.460 --> 16:54.210
she's a lower ranked god than me.

16:54.210 --> 16:58.840
I just said a few words, and they kissed 
the ground and submitted to me.

17:01.680 --> 17:04.120
Please, Dakini!

17:04.120 --> 17:07.060
I'm! Begging! You!

17:07.060 --> 17:10.900
Please, Dakini!

17:10.900 --> 17:13.900
Somehow there's a human 
who's using your powers!

17:13.900 --> 17:16.220
Please help me!

17:18.740 --> 17:22.660
Oh, you mean those archon thingies.

17:23.200 --> 17:26.410
Looks like they're kinda running wild.

17:27.080 --> 17:28.790
That's right!

17:28.790 --> 17:31.750
I beg you to do something to stop her power!

17:31.750 --> 17:32.540
For Yukito!

17:32.540 --> 17:34.050
This is for Yukito!

17:34.050 --> 17:37.050
I! Beg! Of! You!

17:37.050 --> 17:39.630
I beg of you!

17:40.140 --> 17:44.220
I! Beg! Of! You!

17:46.390 --> 17:48.310
I beg of you!

17:48.310 --> 17:52.270
As a god, aren't you 
ashamed to be doing this?

17:53.520 --> 17:59.110
<i>For Yukito. For Yukito. 
For Yukito. For Yukito.</i>

17:53.520 --> 17:59.110
I don't know if bottom feeders with a measly 
few thousand followers should be called gods,

17:59.110 --> 18:04.080
but I think you should still maintain 
at least a modicum of pride.

17:59.110 --> 18:07.250
<i>For Yukito. For Yukito. 
For Yukito. For Yukito.</i>

18:07.250 --> 18:11.790
I suppose it's for a pitiable 
self-proclaimed god.

18:11.790 --> 18:16.150
I'll stop her power for just a short while.

18:21.430 --> 18:23.390
You call yourself a god on borrowed power!

18:23.390 --> 18:25.140
That's so pathetic!

18:25.140 --> 18:27.310
In the end, you're also just a normal human!

18:27.310 --> 18:29.750
You get it now?!

18:29.750 --> 18:31.710
This is my power!

18:32.600 --> 18:35.520
Enough of your nonsense!

18:37.260 --> 18:40.110
She... She can already move?

18:40.950 --> 18:42.820
Well done, my underling!

18:43.410 --> 18:46.490
I don't recall being...

18:46.490 --> 18:47.490
that!

18:53.170 --> 18:54.150
Hey!

18:54.390 --> 18:56.880
<i>I'm at a disadvantage in direct combat.</i>

18:57.210 --> 18:59.380
<i>I'll need to recover and—</i>

19:01.090 --> 19:02.720
Gohonzon-sama.

19:02.720 --> 19:04.720
Excellent timing!

19:06.180 --> 19:10.230
I'm leaving for a bit, so you delay them!

19:19.570 --> 19:21.440
I won't let you get away.

19:21.900 --> 19:25.350
If I join you now, 
Mitama-sama will fall for me!

19:26.430 --> 19:27.240
Wha?

19:28.160 --> 19:29.040
Ew.

19:29.040 --> 19:30.200
Yikes.

19:30.540 --> 19:33.460
I read the note you gave me, Yukito!

19:33.690 --> 19:35.920
Roy, are you really all right with this?

19:35.920 --> 19:36.860
This is...

19:37.380 --> 19:39.130
What's this?

19:39.590 --> 19:42.510
If you help them when they're in danger,

19:42.510 --> 19:44.030
women will fall for you.

19:44.760 --> 19:48.430
Roy, in the end, Mitama's a woman, too.

19:48.430 --> 19:50.390
You get where I'm going with this, Roy?

19:50.390 --> 19:51.560
What?

19:52.230 --> 19:54.480
In the end, Mitama is a woman, too.

19:54.480 --> 19:55.560
I see.

19:55.560 --> 19:57.400
I get it Yukito.

19:57.400 --> 19:59.020
Thank you.

20:00.400 --> 20:02.190
This should do it, right?!

20:04.150 --> 20:06.450
I reconsidered!

20:06.450 --> 20:08.320
Rather than for my right hand,

20:08.320 --> 20:11.890
I live for my love for Mitama-sama!

20:12.100 --> 20:13.660
Let go, you filth!

20:13.660 --> 20:15.250
You're so creepy!

20:15.250 --> 20:17.880
Goodbye, my right hand.

20:17.880 --> 20:20.550
It's over, Dakini.

20:31.600 --> 20:32.870
How?

20:33.560 --> 20:37.690
I have more followers than you.

20:38.150 --> 20:40.730
You know you're in deep shit, right, Roy?

20:38.900 --> 20:42.650
The weakest ones have 
their own way of fighting.

20:40.730 --> 20:42.650
I'm so sorry!

20:43.940 --> 20:46.530
You're fighting all by yourself.

20:48.030 --> 20:49.700
When we get back to the village,

20:48.030 --> 20:52.410
But we have so many people 
who are willing to fight.

20:49.700 --> 20:51.030
you're going to hell!

20:51.030 --> 20:52.410
Please have mercy!

20:52.910 --> 20:56.040
I haven't... lost yet.

20:56.910 --> 21:00.500
I will return this world 
to how it used to be...

21:01.210 --> 21:03.170
I swear it!

21:03.170 --> 21:04.460
Dakini-sama.

21:09.760 --> 21:10.680
Riche.

21:11.550 --> 21:14.350
I specifically had my eye 
set on you, then this!

21:14.890 --> 21:17.730
You were from the same 
isolation camp as Toko!

21:17.730 --> 21:19.600
You liked pervy things!

21:19.600 --> 21:20.310
So it's true.

21:21.400 --> 21:23.270
You did know her.

21:23.820 --> 21:25.070
Toka.

21:26.110 --> 21:28.280
My mother.

21:29.740 --> 21:32.870
I am Toka's daughter.

21:36.620 --> 21:37.410
Hey!

21:39.750 --> 21:41.290
Dakini.

21:42.250 --> 21:43.670
Hello?

21:43.670 --> 21:44.960
Are you listening?

21:44.960 --> 21:46.840
Dakini.

21:48.720 --> 21:52.010
I'd like a baby.

21:53.550 --> 21:56.560
Just stay put and the 
assembly will make you one.

21:56.560 --> 22:00.440
Hmm. But that's not the same, huh?

22:00.440 --> 22:02.770
You can make one if you have love, right?

22:02.770 --> 22:07.030
Isn't that why you said 
that love is so important?

22:09.860 --> 22:13.990
So why do you want a baby?

22:14.330 --> 22:15.700
Well...

22:15.700 --> 22:17.790
if I found someone I like,

22:17.790 --> 22:19.620
and then a baby was born,

22:19.620 --> 22:21.870
and then we all lived happily together,

22:21.870 --> 22:23.670
wouldn't that be so wonderful?

22:25.070 --> 22:29.840
And then, once that child grows up...

22:34.350 --> 22:39.020
I'd want them to become 
good friends with you, too!

22:42.940 --> 22:47.480
<i>The one who made the world twisted was me.</i>

22:47.480 --> 22:50.820
<i>I'm the one who changed people's hearts.</i>

22:50.820 --> 22:54.490
<i>I erased love from this world.</i>

22:55.910 --> 22:59.160
It's my... it's my fault!

23:02.670 --> 23:03.830
I'm sorry!

23:03.830 --> 23:05.960
I'm so sorry!

23:15.960 --> 23:17.510
Toka...

23:21.680 --> 23:23.270
I love you so much.

23:25.690 --> 23:27.110
I love you.

23:28.340 --> 23:34.490
I love you so much, Toka.

